   "fix": "Factor out `instance [IsIso f] (i : I) : IsIso (f.natTrans.app i)`, proved once with `\u27e8(inv f).natTrans.app i, by simp [\u2190 NatTrans.comp_app, \u2190 comp_natTrans], by simp [\u2190 NatTrans.comp_app, \u2190 comp_natTrans]\u27e9`. Then use it in `isIso_iff`.",
